. frame change networks_single

. 
. * 1a. row sums: export weights sum to one at the source, REST included; a
. *     source whose world exports in a sector are zero weighs zero
. foreach k of local HS {
  2.     bysort year source: egen double rs = total(export_`k')
  3.     assert abs(rs - 1) < 1e-10 | rs == 0 if year >= 2016 & source != "REST"
  4.     drop rs
  5. }

. 
. * 1b. direct formula: the weights against the recorded world totals
. frame create chk

. frame chk {
.     import delimited using "../4_inputs/check_weights.csv", clear varnames(1) asdouble stringcols(2 3 4)
(encoding automatically selected: ISO-8859-1)
(5 vars, 55,080 obs)
.     reshape wide export_direct, i(year source target) j(hs) string
(j = 41 42 43 50 51 52 53 54 56 57 58 59 60 61 62 63 64 65)

Data                               Long   ->   Wide
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Number of observations           55,080   ->   3,060       
Number of variables                   5   ->   21          
j variable (18 values)               hs   ->   (dropped)
xij variables:
                          export_direct   ->   export_direct41 export_direct42 ... export_direct65
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.     gen edge_id = source + "_" + target
.     keep year edge_id export_direct*
. }

. frlink m:1 year edge_id, frame(chk)
